{"id":"4010143666291036271","query":"演唱会","source_queries":["演唱会"],"text":"每次看yoga演唱会我都要戒断，所以导致现在还没有睡着。\n我十四岁开始很喜欢他，上次见他还是23年的idol，现在我工作了，陷入压力和挣扎，他前阵子也面临了痛苦。\n昨天的他很柔和又很脆弱，像鸭绒枕头一样柔软，退场后又回来，整整唱了三个小时，每次退场我都在喊不要走…好像很疲惫的灵魂好不容易休息又要被抽离。\n嘉宾是王源，好巧我在waa歌手唱完雪崩后很喜欢这首歌一直期待林宥嘉可以唱，而王源刚好来苏州场当嘉宾，刚好合唱了这首，幸福得我一直流眼泪。\n我们之后都会变好的，对吗","username":"ddll_hoholic","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@ddll_hoholic/post/Dem5Gr3j1Bv","timestamp":"2026-10-17T19:47:42Z","media_type":"VIDEO","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱会"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-18T05:46:48.571063143Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-18T05:47:06.027414Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-18T05:47:06.027414Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_17bd2f6ced77823b","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4010247823610303662","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"Hiii 🫶🏻 Someone interested to attend Bruno Mars Concert next year in Manila? \n\n- I have 2x tickets available 🎟️🌹\n- Willing to surrender TMPH acc first\n- Willing VC/Meet Up \n- Same SRP, no add, no dp! \n\nRfs. Unexpectedly, got ticket from relative sa Japan as their bday gift to me. Will attend Bruno Mars con at Osaka instead. 🥹🥹 \n\nIf walang kukuha, okay lang din hahaha. We can still attend naman, just in case anyone is interested 😊 Tia! 🫶🏻\n\nUBB | DAY 2 📩📩","username":"honyc.babe","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@honyc.babe/post/DenQyX7k1Su","timestamp":"2026-10-17T23:13:35Z","media_type":"IMAGE","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-18T05:46:59.927183558Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-18T05:47:06.027414Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-18T05:47:06.027414Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_f9dbf48dcb97df57","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
