{"id":"4010306235266684001","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"I'm seeing some interesting things happening around 82World. Granted, I'm not there. However let me impart some advice cuz I think a lot of folks are treating this like a concert and .... It's not. \n\n1) It is not the event organizers responsibility to supply water outside the event (eg. until you get through gate/security). If you plan on standing in line for a long time, please prepare ahead of time. Bring a large water disposable bottle (eg. 24oz+) and fill it with Liquid IV (electrolytes).","username":"serenity_otep","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@serenity_otep/post/DeneEYBmtRh","timestamp":"2026-10-18T01:09:38Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-18T05:46:59.927209035Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-18T05:47:06.027414Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-18T05:47:06.027414Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_6c6202eb72dd292a","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4010309341459076127","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"終於等到杰倫演唱會❤️\n來澳洲第一年 他剛開完 第二年 他台灣開\n第三場 終於換我🙋🏻 \n沒有什麼大舞台 可能配合澳洲風情\n然後 真的不噴不行欸 \n我真的尊重每一個來看演唱會的人\n畢竟每個人都有自己享受的方式\n但真的 點歌環節到底是三小啦幹？？？\n沒有抽到一個台灣人\n前幾個點歌的都是智障吧\n杰倫都一直問要點那首了 一直說不是說一次\n還一直嘰哩呱啦 真的是氣死🙄\n七里香壓軸被點走 然後點奧運歌是蛤？？？？\n肯定會很興奮緊張 但真的 尊重一下杰倫吧\n原本點歌超過10首 可能被拖時間剩8.9首\n我是花錢來聽演唱會的 不是來聽你生長背景的\n阿最後一個影片 杰倫是懂觀眾想看什麼的😎","username":"chang_____0109","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@chang_____0109/post/Denexk5GVQf","timestamp":"2026-10-18T01:15:49Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-18T05:46:37.204073379Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-18T05:47:06.027414Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-18T05:47:06.027414Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_0f370005a4cdc5d4","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
